{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026R68MoIQ3Fi1795131529.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網易上季度經調整淨利潤，按年倒退百分之3.5。</p><p></p><p>至約91億元人民幣。純利84億元人民幣，下跌百分之2.4。派第三季度股息，每股0.117美元。期內收入278億元人民幣，下跌百分之1.7。</p><p></p><p>當中收入佔比最多的遊戲及相關增值服務，下跌百分之1.6，至229億元人民幣。智能學習業務有道，下跌一成二，網易雲音樂跌百分之0.9，創新及其他升百分之7。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:43:53.452370+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T23:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T12:57:14.117622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:37:17.106169+00:00","content_hash":"e9719b42bfaa0f1880faaeaed0868664258aaaa06eaa60fd690aa6ce5bfe0388","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:43:53.452370+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}